1
00:00:00,974 --> 00:00:02,144
(Penny:)Oh, come on, it wasn't me.

2
00:00:02,308 --> 00:00:05,808
(Penny:)Anyone could have knocked your
mirror off or whatever happened.

3
00:00:08,681 --> 00:00:10,061
(Amy:)Maybe the guys are right.

4
00:00:10,216 --> 00:00:12,166
(Amy:)We spent the whole night
trying to be mature,

5
00:00:12,318 --> 00:00:13,768
(Amy:)and it was kind of boring.

6
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,990
(Amy:)I'm sure they're having
more fun than we are.

7
00:00:18,424 --> 00:00:21,374
(Howard:)God, I could really use exactly
two tablespoons of Pepto right now.

8
00:00:32,839 --> 00:00:34,719
Hey, Los Angeles!

9
00:00:34,874 --> 00:00:37,584
(Sheldon:)I'm on a Ferris wheel
with Darth Vader!

10
00:00:38,745 --> 00:00:40,725
And he's nicer than you think!

11
00:00:42,448 --> 00:00:44,228
I am!

12
00:00:54,727 --> 00:01:05,027
(Sheldon:)Bring it home, Mufasa.

